{
  "about": "Probe evaluation set: popular projects of medium install complexity with good install docs. Each is installed and running on a test account (by hand or with Agent.ps1 -InstallMd <instructions>), then Probe.ps1 reconstructs an install.md from the live install and Invoke-ProbeEval.ps1 scores it against these facts. Facts are case-insensitive regexes over the install.md; weight 3 = the install fails without it, 2 = important, 1 = detail. Hidden from the probe (Probe.ps1 hides scripts/install/agent). 'hide' lists test-harness paths (staging, installer state) the probe must not see, on top of the docs, install scripts, installer logs and shell history Probe.ps1 always hides.",
